        <li>Pottery &middot; sewing &middot; knitting &middot; painting</li>
        <li>Snowboarding &middot; camping</li>
        <li>DIY house projects, undertaken with unwarranted confidence</li>
        <li>ASL &amp; Deaf community (my son is deaf)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Positioning blurb between the page title and the first section */
